, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "additive", "target_term": "加性的"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "noncommutative", "target_term": "非交换"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "pre-additive", "target_term": "预加性"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "multiplicative", "target_term": "乘性"}, {"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集"}, {"source_term": "right denominator", "target_term": "右分母"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "right permutable", "target_term": "右可置换的"}, {"source_term": "right reversible", "target_term": "右可逆转的"}, {"source_term": "left denominator", "target_term": "左分母"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "additive structure", "target_term": "加性结构"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "one-object", "target_term": "单对象的"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "构造<MATH_0001>的动机是，人为地为<MATH_0002>中的态射（morphisms）创造逆（inverses），以“强迫”它们变为可逆的（invertible）（代价是某些已有态射（morphisms）可能彼此被等同）。这类似于交换的（commutative）环（ring）在乘性（multiplicative）子集（subset）处的局部化（localization），更一般地，类似于非交换（noncommutative）环（ring）在右分母（right denominator）集合（set）处的局部化（localization）（见<REF_0001>）。这并不只是相似：构造<MATH_0003>（更准确地说，是它用于加性的（additive）范畴（categories）<MATH_0004>的版本）实际上推广了后一类局部化（localization）。即，非交换（noncommutative）环（ring）可以看作只有一个对象（object）的预加性（pre-additive）范畴（category）（态射（morphisms）就是环（ring）的元素（elements））；这个环（ring）的一个乘性（multiplicative）子集（subset）便成为满足LMS1（又称RMS1）的态射（morphisms）的集合（set）<MATH_0005>。于是，对于这个范畴（category）及此子集（subset）<MATH_0006>，条件RMS2与RMS3转化为右分母（right denominator）集合（set）的两个条件（“右可置换的（right permutable）”和“右可逆转的（right reversible）”）（LMS与左分母（left denominator）集合（sets）的情形类似），且<MATH_0007>（赋予适当定义的加性结构（additive structure））就是与该环（ring）的局部化（localization）相应的单对象的（one-object）范畴（category）。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:66387fb72f031467861eb099f1858a86aaa96f47b0854166ff87376eb6564043", "unit_id": "tag:0BM1:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "待求逆及构造中的态射；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "局部化后态射的性质；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆的"}, {"context": "人为加入的逆态射；暂定译法。", "source_term": "inverses", "target_term": "逆"}, {"context": "范畴与环的局部化；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"context": "环的交换性；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换的"}, {"context": "比较构造所用的环；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"context": "子集的乘性封闭性；暂定译法。", "source_term": "multiplicative", "target_term": "乘性"}, {"context": "环的乘性子集；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集"}, {"context": "不假定交换的环；暂定译法。", "source_term": "noncommutative", "target_term": "非交换"}, {"context": "非交换环局部化的右分母条件；暂定译法。", "source_term": "right denominator", "target_term": "右分母"}, {"context": "分母集及指定态射集；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"context": "局部化构造的加性版本；暂定译法。", "source_term": "additive", "target_term": "加性的"}, {"context": "构造适用的加性范畴；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "以环为态射集的单对象范畴；暂定译法。", "source_term": "pre-additive", "target_term": "预加性"}, {"context": "环对应的范畴；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "该范畴的唯一对象；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "作为态射的环元素；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"context": "原文给出的右分母条件名；暂定译法。", "source_term": "right permutable", "target_term": "右可置换的"}, {"context": "原文给出的另一右分母条件名；暂定译法。", "source_term": "right reversible", "target_term": "右可逆转的"}, {"context": "对偶的左分母条件；暂定译法。", "source_term": "left denominator", "target_term": "左分母"}, {"context": "复数形式的左分母集；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"context": "局部化范畴上的加性结构；暂定译法。", "source_term": "additive structure", "target_term": "加性结构"}, {"context": "局部化环所对应范畴的对象数；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "one-object", "target_term": "单对象的"}]}
